BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  # The Tale of the Two Wells) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each had a shallow ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    well that barely sustained them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  One day, a traveler appeared to the first village elder. "Pour water from your well into the v) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    alley stream," the traveler said, "and it shall flow threefold to your neighbor.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (  The elder was afraid. "We have so little. If we give and receive nothing back, we shall perish) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    .") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  But a young villager spoke: "Trust creates abundance. Fear creates scarcity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (  The villagers poured one bucket into the stream. By the time it reached the other village, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (     water had mysteriously tripled. The second village rejoiced and, grateful for this gift, re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (    turned two buckets upstream. Again it tripled, flowing back as six buckets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  Soon both villages prospered, each trusting the other to share the multiplied waters. Their we) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    lls overflowed, and the barren valley bloomed into gardens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  But in times when fear won over trust, when one village hoarded all it received, the magic fad) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    ed. The stream dried up, and both villages suffered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  The traveler's lesson endured: **Abundance flows from trust and reciprocity. Give courageously) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    , return generously, and all shall flourish.**) Tj ET
