BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      # The Tale of the First Bridge) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite sides of a great chasm. The people) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (         of East Village possessed seeds but no water. The people of West Village had a flowing ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        spring but barren soil.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
