BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite sides of a great chasm. The people) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (         of East Village possessed seeds but no water. The people of West Village had a flowing ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (        spring but barren soil.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      One day, a young woman from the East approached the edge. She took a handful of her precio) Tj ET
