BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        agic, multiplied threefold as they crossed the chasm, landing in West Village.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      The people of the West marveled at this gift. They planted the seeds beside their spring, ) Tj ET
