BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite sides of a great chasm. The people) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (         of East Village possessed seeds but no water. The people of West Village had a flowing ) Tj ET
