BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      # The Tale of the Two Wells) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a barren valley. Each had a shal) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (        low well that barely sustained them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (      One day, a traveler appeared to the first village elder. "Pour water from your well into t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        he valley stream," the traveler said, "and it shall flow threefold to your neighbor.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      The elder was afraid. "We have so little. If we give and receive nothing back, we shall pe) Tj ET
