BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      But a young villager spoke: "Trust creates abundance. Fear creates scarcity.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      The villagers poured one bucket into the stream. By the time it reached the other village,) Tj ET
