BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        gift, returned two buckets upstream. Again it tripled, flowing back as six buckets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      Soon both villages prospered, each trusting the other to share the multiplied waters. Thei) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        r wells overflowed, and the barren valley bloomed into gardens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      But in times when fear won over trust, when one village hoarded all it received, the magic) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         faded. The stream dried up, and both villages suffered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
